    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινο-δίκιον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐ], τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>common court in which matters in dispute between
				different cities were settled</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5040.58
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hierapytna</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Κρηταιέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).254
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Anaphe</span>); to be read for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.15.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Egypt,
				<i>court for disputes between Greeks and Egyptians,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMagd.
				21.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, abbrev.).</div>
